l work once it is available and you will be able to submit your shipping address. The map art on this redemption token commemorates Flying Bastion's first adventures in map making, 22 years ago.\n","img":"Qmch987Zw5RnjBv7PVXRc1Lhcv6SoUv5UxPjR533ey2peR","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"pixilminiwax","templateId":255664}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":583006}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":1099,"col":"pixilminiwax","cat":"Coin","name":"Artifact Royal Rook --> usable new Gold Royal Rook","desc":"There were only 1000 of these coins created under the \"artifact\" schema, but then with the decision to make multiple coin tiers, new gold coins were made under a different \"coins\" schema. The old artifact coins are called just \"Royal Rook\" and the new ones are called \"Gold Royal Rook\". The old artifact coins do not work for the blends or super blends, so this blend is set up in case you want to use them for this purpose. However, many might say these are more valuable as a collector's item than trading 1:1 for a new coin, so I will warn you to choose carefully... but the choice is yours!","img":"QmRVfkA1j17i52UyN6WVzskSFKTMGfiyVDtWbXeNUcBENR","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"pixilminiwax","templateId":233761}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":284899}]}]}],"unsupported":false}]}